\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Simulation against the photographed cable. The extraction's frame is calibrated on the two outer clamps, which are level in the apparatus; the middle clamp is recovered to within 14\nobreakspace  {}mm as an independent check (Section\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {sec:validity}), which bounds the accuracy of these figures.}}{5}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
